## Implementation Details

### Parsing System
- **State Machine**: Tracks parsing context (robot count, rooms, tunnels)
- **Command Recognition**: Identifies special commands and comments
- **Room Name Mapping**: Maintains mapping from names to internal IDs
- **Connection Building**: Builds bidirectional connections from tunnel definitions

### Pathfinding Optimization
- **Adjacency Matrix**: Efficient O(1) connection lookups
- **Distance Arrays**: Separate arrays for distances, previous nodes, and visited flags
- **Early Termination**: Stops when target room reached
- **Path Reconstruction**: Builds complete path from previous node references

### Robot Coordination
- **Collision Avoidance**: Checks room occupancy before movement
- **Turn Synchronization**: All robots move simultaneously per turn
- **Path Independence**: Each robot follows its own optimal path
- **Special Rooms**: Start and end rooms allow unlimited occupancy

